15-15 Shout pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (h Handle=string), results: (Handle=string)
19-19 Halve pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (a Amount=int64, l Level=uint8), results: (Amount=int64)
22-22 NormalizeHandle pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    invariant: idempotent
    params: (h Handle=string), results: (Handle=string)
25-25 FormatAmount pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (a Amount=int64), results: (string)
25-25 FormatAmount roundtrip: pairs with ParseAmount, no I/O
    partner: ParseAmount
    params: (a Amount=int64), results: (string)
27-30 ParseAmount pure-func: basic params, no I/O
    params: (s string), results: (Amount=int64, error?)
32-37 ValidateHandle validation: name Validate*, returns error
    named validator
    params: (h Handle=string), results: (error?)
46-49 Account json-roundtrip: has json tags
    fields: (Owner Handle=string, Balance Amount=int64)
